    "description": "Thanks to the rapid development of technology, a famous technology company has created a system where electronic devices can become mobile and move in any direction. Şakir and his family are admirers of the products made by this company. However, the owner of the company, an investor named Harun, had organized exploration trips in the past under the leadership of Şakir’s grandmother, the archaeologist Seniha. During these trips, they discovered a stone from prehistoric times. The mysterious evil power trapped inside this stone, in which it had been locked for centuries, is released and possesses Harun. Harun activates the technological army which he has created to take over the world. Meanwhile, Şakir and his family will try to find their lost grandmother Seniha and simultaneously protect the world from evil.",
